 the real man behind the mask?</li></ul><br>A story of apprenticeship and power mixed with spell-binding twists ... <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1337530/extras/7efda787b9cefd41c745e9720fd5c4cf.poster.avif?t=1710941372\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1337530/extras/7efda787b9cefd41c745e9720fd5c4cf.webm?t=1710941372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1337530/extras/7efda787b9cefd41c745e9720fd5c4cf.mp4?t=1710941372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
